   "key": "func VitalsScoring.calculateVitalsScore(vitals:baselineStats:)",
   "hash": "b44fe97954fc2533",
   "does": "Averages the available vitals sub-scores (sleep/resting HR vs personal baseline, respiratory rate vs 7-day baseline or population window, wrist-temperature deviation step score) into a 0-100 score; returns nil when vitals is nil or no sub-score is computable (SpO2 alone yields nil).",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/VitalsScoring.swift::func VitalsScoring.restingHRSubScore(vitals:baselineStats:)",
